---
component: wire
params:
  to: { enum: [board, varn] }
  sender: string
beat:
  on: hourStrikes
  once: run
  title: "A wire from @sender"
  when: "run.hour == 'h06' && run.wired == '@to'"
---

## A wire

::sfx{sound="platform bell"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: A telegraph boy runs the length of platform four with a buff envelope held over his head. It is for you. It is from {{@sender}}.
::body
@inspector{code="0010" mono}: Four o'clock at Harl, one wire, one answer. It had better be the right question.
